{
  "$comment": "Request/response JSON Schemas (draft 2020-12) for vllm.postman_collection.json, rendered into its items' descriptions and VLLM_SCHEMAS.md (linked from VLLM.md). Edit here, then: uv run --no-sync python scripts/api_schemas.py render vllm. An OPEN subset (additionalProperties: true) of an upstream server: the fields this stack and the collection use, each entry's `$comment` naming its source and image tag (vllm/vllm-openai:v0.29.0 (qwen3.6, vllm-qwen-vl, muse-glimmer) and v0.27.1 (qwen3.8, qwen3.8-solo)). The `openai_*` definitions are the OpenAI-compatible subset shared with llama.schemas.json and litellm.schemas.json, whose OpenAI entries point here (same_as). Checked by unit-tests/apidocs only (tier 1); an image-tag bump re-checks them (ai/vllm/CLAUDE.md).",
  "service": "vllm",
  "doc": "VLLM.md",
  "$defs": {
    "openai_chat_completion": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "vLLM ChatCompletionResponse (open subset); the same shape from llama-server and LiteLLM",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "object",
        "created",
        "model",
        "choices",
        "usage"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "object": {
          "const": "chat.completion"
        },
        "created": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Unix seconds"
        },
        "model": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "What the request named (LiteLLM: `auto` stays `auto`)"
        },
        "choices": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "required": [
              "index",
              "message",
              "finish_reason"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "index": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "required": [
                  "role"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "role": {
                    "const": "assistant"
                  },
                  "content": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "description": "The answer (null when the turn only calls tools)"
                  },
                  "reasoning": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "description": "vLLM: the reasoning parser's output (`--reasoning-parser`), kept out of `content`"
                  },
                  "reasoning_content": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "description": "llama-server and LiteLLM (which maps vLLM's `reasoning` onto it): the same reasoning text"
                  },
                  "tool_calls": {
                    "type": [
                      "array",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_tool_call"
                    },
                    "description": "The parsed tool calls (`--tool-call-parser` on vLLM, `--jinja` on llama-server); absent when none"
                  }
                }
              },
              "finish_reason": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ],
                "description": "`stop`, `length`, `tool_calls`, …"
              },
              "logprobs": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_chat_logprobs"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "usage": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_usage"
        },
        "system_fingerprint": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "timings": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "description": "llama-server only: prompt and generation speed (`cache_n`, `prompt_n`, `prompt_ms`, `predicted_n`, `predicted_per_second`, …)"
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_chat_completion_chunk": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "vLLM ChatCompletionStreamResponse (open subset); the same shape from llama-server and LiteLLM",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "object",
        "created",
        "model",
        "choices"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "object": {
          "const": "chat.completion.chunk"
        },
        "created": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "model": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "choices": {
          "type": "array",
          "description": "Empty on a final usage-only chunk",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "required": [
              "index",
              "delta"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "index": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "delta": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "description": "What this chunk adds; concatenate `content` (and the reasoning field) across chunks",
                "properties": {
                  "role": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ]
                  },
                  "content": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ]
                  },
                  "reasoning": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "description": "vLLM: the reasoning parser's output (`--reasoning-parser`), kept out of `content`"
                  },
                  "reasoning_content": {
                    "type": [
                      "string",
                      "null"
                    ],
                    "description": "llama-server and LiteLLM (which maps vLLM's `reasoning` onto it): the same reasoning text"
                  },
                  "tool_calls": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": true,
                      "required": [
                        "index"
                      ],
                      "properties": {
                        "index": {
                          "type": "integer"
                        },
                        "id": {
                          "type": [
                            "string",
                            "null"
                          ]
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": [
                            "string",
                            "null"
                          ]
                        },
                        "function": {
                          "type": [
                            "object",
                            "null"
                          ],
                          "additionalProperties": true,
                          "properties": {
                            "name": {
                              "type": [
                                "string",
                                "null"
                              ]
                            },
                            "arguments": {
                              "type": [
                                "string",
                                "null"
                              ],
                              "description": "A fragment of the JSON arguments"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "finish_reason": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ],
                "description": "Set on the choice's last chunk"
              },
              "logprobs": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_chat_logprobs"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "usage": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_usage"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "On the last chunk with `stream_options.include_usage` (LiteLLM and llama-server send it unasked)"
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_chat_logprobs": {
      "type": [
        "object",
        "null"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "vLLM ChatCompletionLogProbs; present when the request set `logprobs: true`",
      "properties": {
        "content": {
          "type": [
            "array",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "One entry per generated token. The classifier reads an integer field's distribution from these (`common.logprobs`)",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "required": [
              "token",
              "logprob"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "token": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "logprob": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "bytes": {
                "type": [
                  "array",
                  "null"
                ],
                "items": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              },
              "top_logprobs": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "required": [
                    "token",
                    "logprob"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "token": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "logprob": {
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    "bytes": {
                      "type": [
                        "array",
                        "null"
                      ],
                      "items": {
                        "type": "integer"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "description": "The `top_logprobs` most likely tokens at this position"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_chat_message": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "OpenAI chat message param",
      "required": [
        "role"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "role": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "`system`, `user`, `assistant` or `tool` in this stack"
        },
        "content": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_content_part"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Text, or a list of content parts (multimodal); null on an assistant message that only calls tools"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "tool_calls": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_tool_call"
          },
          "description": "On an assistant message: the calls it made"
        },
        "tool_call_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "On a `tool` message: the call it answers"
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_chat_request": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "OpenAI Chat Completions request: the fields this stack sends (vLLM ChatCompletionRequest has ~70; llama-server and LiteLLM accept the same names)",
      "required": [
        "model",
        "messages"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "model": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "vLLM: the `--served-model-name` (any other is a 404, \"The model … does not exist.\"); llama-server: its `-a` alias (not enforced); LiteLLM: a `model_name`, chain alias or `auto`, which it routes on"
        },
        "messages": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_chat_message"
          }
        },
        "stream": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "true: a `text/event-stream` of `chat.completion.chunk` payloads"
        },
        "stream_options": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "properties": {
            "include_usage": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "A last chunk carries `usage`"
            }
          }
        },
        "max_tokens": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "max_completion_tokens": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "temperature": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "top_p": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "top_k": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Not OpenAI; vLLM and llama-server"
        },
        "min_p": {
          "type": "number",
          "description": "Not OpenAI; vLLM and llama-server"
        },
        "presence_penalty": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "frequency_penalty": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "seed": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "n": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Choices to sample (the classifier's sampling confidence)"
        },
        "stop": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "logprobs": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "top_logprobs": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "response_format": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "required": [
            "type"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "enum": [
                "text",
                "json_object",
                "json_schema"
              ],
              "description": "`json_object`: the answer is constrained to JSON (llama-server turns it into a grammar)"
            },
            "json_schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true
            }
          }
        },
        "tools": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_tool"
          }
        },
        "tool_choice": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "parallel_tool_calls": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "reasoning_effort": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "chat_template_kwargs": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "description": "Not OpenAI (vLLM, llama-server): variables for the chat template. This stack sends `enable_thinking` (Qwen), `reasoning_effort` (the fixed Qwen template; glm5.3-flash takes `low` | `high`) and `reasoning_strength` (muse-glimmer). Through LiteLLM a request's value REPLACES the deployment's, it is not merged"
        },
        "user": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_completion_request": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "OpenAI (legacy) Completions request: the fields this stack sends (vLLM CompletionRequest)",
      "required": [
        "model",
        "prompt"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "model": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "As for chat completions"
        },
        "prompt": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "Fed to the model verbatim: no chat template, so no reasoning or tool parsing"
        },
        "max_tokens": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "vLLM's default is 16"
        },
        "temperature": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "top_p": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "stop": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "stream": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false
        },
        "logprobs": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "echo": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "seed": {
          "type": "integer"
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_content_part": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "OpenAI chat content part; the stack sends `text` and `image_url` parts",
      "required": [
        "type"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "`text` or `image_url` in this stack"
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "image_url": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "required": [
            "url"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "url": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "An http(s) URL the server fetches, or a `data:image/...;base64,` URI"
            },
            "detail": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_model_list": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "vLLM ModelList (open subset); llama-server and LiteLLM send the same envelope",
      "required": [
        "object",
        "data"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "object": {
          "const": "list"
        },
        "data": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "required": [
              "id",
              "object"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "What a request's `model` must be: vLLM's `--served-model-name` (else the HF repo id, as on vllm-qwen-vl), llama-server's `-a` alias, a LiteLLM `model_name`"
              },
              "object": {
                "const": "model"
              },
              "created": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "owned_by": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "`vllm`, `llamacpp`, `openai` (LiteLLM)"
              },
              "root": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ],
                "description": "vLLM: the model path or repo"
              },
              "max_model_len": {
                "type": [
                  "integer",
                  "null"
                ],
                "description": "vLLM: `--max-model-len`"
              },
              "meta": {
                "type": [
                  "object",
                  "null"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "description": "llama-server: `n_ctx_train`, `n_params`, `size`, … (null while the model loads)"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_text_completion": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "vLLM CompletionResponse (open subset); llama-server sends the same shape",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "object",
        "created",
        "model",
        "choices"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "object": {
          "const": "text_completion"
        },
        "created": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "model": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "choices": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "required": [
              "index",
              "text"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "index": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "text": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "finish_reason": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ],
                "description": "Set on the choice's last fragment when streaming"
              },
              "logprobs": {
                "type": [
                  "object",
                  "null"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": true
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "usage": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_usage"
        },
        "timings": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "description": "llama-server only"
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_tool": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "OpenAI tool definition (vLLM ChatCompletionToolsParam)",
      "required": [
        "type",
        "function"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "type": {
          "const": "function"
        },
        "function": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "required": [
            "name"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "description": "A JSON Schema for the arguments"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_tool_call": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "OpenAI tool call (vLLM ToolCall)",
      "required": [
        "id",
        "type",
        "function"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "type": {
          "const": "function"
        },
        "function": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "required": [
            "name",
            "arguments"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "arguments": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "The arguments as a JSON-encoded string"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "openai_usage": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "$comment": "vLLM UsageInfo; llama-server and LiteLLM send the same keys",
      "required": [
        "prompt_tokens",
        "total_tokens"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "prompt_tokens": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "completion_tokens": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "total_tokens": {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "prompt_tokens_details": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "properties": {
            "cached_tokens": {
              "type": [
                "integer",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "Prompt tokens served from the prefix cache. vLLM fills it only with `--enable-prompt-tokens-details` (muse-glimmer); the classifier records it per call kind"
            }
          }
        },
        "completion_tokens_details": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "properties": {
            "reasoning_tokens": {
              "type": [
                "integer",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "Completion tokens spent reasoning, where the server counts them"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "endpoints": {
    "GET /health": {
      "$comment": "vLLM vllm/entrypoints/serve/instrumentator/health.py at the v0.29.0 tag (the box's GET /openapi.json declares no body); vllm/vllm-openai:v0.29.0 (qwen3.6, vllm-qwen-vl, muse-glimmer) and v0.27.1 (qwen3.8, qwen3.8-solo).",
      "description": "The HTTP server starts only after the model has loaded, so a starting container refuses connections rather than answering 503.",
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "description": "the engine is up"
        },
        "503": {
          "description": "the engine has died (EngineDeadError)"
        }
      }
    },
    "GET /v1/models": {
      "$comment": "OpenAI List Models (vLLM ModelList). vLLM: request fields checked against the box's GET /openapi.json (muse-glimmer, v0.29.0), which declares no 200 bodies, so the response shapes come from vllm/entrypoints/openai/{models,chat_completion,completion}/ and vllm/entrypoints/serve/engine/protocol.py at the v0.29.0 tag (the same field names at v0.27.1); vllm/vllm-openai:v0.29.0 (qwen3.6, vllm-qwen-vl, muse-glimmer) and v0.27.1 (qwen3.8, qwen3.8-solo). Also served by llama.cpp llama-server: ghcr.io/ggml-org/llama.cpp:server-cuda (glm5.2, a moving tag) and Unsloth's b10796-mix-659e406 / b10840-mix-d5c17a0 builds (tools/server/README.md at those tags) and by LiteLLM v1.95.0 (docker.litellm.ai/berriai/litellm:v1.95.0), whose entries point here (same_as). An image-tag bump on any of them re-checks it.",
      "description": "The OpenAI model list, shared by vLLM, llama-server and LiteLLM. A vLLM server lists exactly one model; LiteLLM lists what the calling key may use.",
      "responses": {
        "200": {
          "content_type": "application/json",
          "schema": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/openai_model_list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "POST /v1/chat/completions": {
